  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:11.940" end="00:15.350" ttm:agent="v1">Saturday, you were gone</p>
      <p begin="00:15.350" end="00:19.070" ttm:agent="v1">And I let him come</p>
      <p begin="00:19.070" end="00:22.170" ttm:agent="v1">A thrill in the unknown</p>
      <p begin="00:22.170" end="00:26.040" ttm:agent="v1">And now I can't stop</p>
      <p begin="00:26.040" end="00:29.670" ttm:agent="v1">Heaven, I lied -</p>
      <p begin="00:29.670" end="00:33.670" ttm:agent="v1">Said &quot;I love,&quot; but meant good-bye</p>
      <p begin="00:33.670" end="00:37.180" ttm:agent="v1">Heaven, I lied -</p>
      <p begin="00:37.180" end="00:41.130" ttm:agent="v1">Can I ever make it right</p>
      <p begin="00:41.130" end="00:44.830" ttm:agent="v1">Things I left unsaid</p>
      <p begin="00:44.830" end="00:48.580" ttm:agent="v1">Spinnin' in my head</p>
      <p begin="00:48.580" end="00:52.360" ttm:agent="v1">Things I left unsaid</p>
      <p begin="00:52.360" end="00:56.020" ttm:agent="v1">Spinnin' - I regret</p>
      <p begin="00:56.020" end="00:59.870" ttm:agent="v1">Things I left unsaid</p>
      <p begin="00:59.870" end="01:03.520" ttm:agent="v1">Spinnin' - I regret</p>
      <p begin="01:03.520" end="01:07.370" ttm:agent="v1">Things I left unsaid</p>
      <p begin="01:07.370" end="01:13.700" ttm:agent="v1">Spinnin' - I regret</p>
      <p begin="01:13.700" end="01:17.370" ttm:agent="v1">Messed up my hair</p>
      <p begin="01:17.370" end="01:21.130" ttm:agent="v1">Love was in the air</p>
      <p begin="01:21.130" end="01:24.060" ttm:agent="v1">He's my new boyfriend</p>
      <p begin="01:24.060" end="01:27.960" ttm:agent="v1">And that's how we end</p>
      <p begin="01:27.960" end="01:31.510" ttm:agent="v1">Heaven, I lied -</p>
      <p begin="01:31.510" end="01:35.490" ttm:agent="v1">Said &quot;I love,&quot; but meant good-bye</p>
      <p begin="01:35.490" end="01:38.930" ttm:agent="v1">Heaven, I lied -</p>
      <p begin="01:38.930" end="01:42.920" ttm:agent="v1">Can I ever make it right</p>
      <p begin="01:42.920" end="01:46.470" ttm:agent="v1">Heaven, I lied -</p>
      <p begin="01:46.470" end="01:50.320" ttm:agent="v1">Said &quot;I love,&quot; but meant good-bye</p>
      <p begin="01:50.320" end="01:54.030" ttm:agent="v1">Heaven, I lied -</p>
      <p begin="01:54.030" end="01:58.040" ttm:agent="v1">Can I ever make it right</p>
      <p begin="01:58.040" end="02:01.730" ttm:agent="v1">Things I left unsaid</p>
      <p begin="02:01.730" end="02:05.490" ttm:agent="v1">Spinnin' in my head</p>
